<div id="S5.SS1.SSS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.SSS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results.</span> Table <a href="#S5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 5.1.2 Referring Object Detection ‣ 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows that WeVisOne-VL consistently outperforms existing VLMs across single-target, multi-target, and absent-target settings. These results demonstrate that WeVisOne-VL localizes referred objects more accurately and rejects absent-target queries more reliably.</p>
</div>
