<div id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results.</span> Table <a href="#S5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 5.1.3 Object Counting ‣ 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows that WeVisOne-VL achieves the highest exact-match accuracy on every reported benchmark and split. It reaches 93.7%/89.6% on PixMo-Count validation/test and 42.0%/40.4% on MixCount validation/test, indicating accurate counts in both natural images and fine-grained mixed-object scenes.</p>
