<div id="S5.SS1.SSS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results.</span> As shown in Table <a href="#S5.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 5.1.4 Object Pointing ‣ 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, WeVisOne-VL achieves the best results on both PointBench and PixMo-Points, demonstrating its ability to point directly to target objects. On the detection-derived benchmarks, it also performs strongly across general detection benchmarks, showing that this ability extends to diverse scenes.</p>
</div>
