<div id="S5.SS1.SSS5.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.SSS5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results.</span> As shown in Table <a href="#S5.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 5.1.5 OCR ‣ 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, WeVisOne-VL consistently outperforms both specialist OCR systems and general-purpose VLMs across all evaluated benchmarks. Its strong performance across dense documents, incidental and curved scene text, and structured receipts demonstrates robust end-to-end text perception under diverse layouts and visual conditions.</p>
</div>
