<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Image matting results under box and language prompts. MAD and MSE are multiplied by <math id="S5.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{3}</annotation></semantics></math>. On WeRefMat, all SAM2-Matting results use the SAM3 variant. <span id="S5.T8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> and <span id="S5.T8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underline</span> denote the best and second-best results, respectively.</figcaption>
