<section id="S6" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">6 </span>Qualitative Analysis</h2>

<div id="S6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present qualitative comparisons between WeVisOne-VL and representative baselines in Figures <a href="#S6.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 6 Qualitative Analysis ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>–<a href="#S6.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ 6 Qualitative Analysis ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>. Each figure is organized by task, and the selected examples below are discussed from top to bottom.</p>
</div>
<div id="S6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
