<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Reinforcement Learning Data</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We apply uncertainty-aware sample selection (Section <a href="#S4" title="4 Training Pipeline ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>) to the SFT data using the SFT checkpoint to construct the RL training set. The final RL set contains 178K examples: 44.0% detection, 20.8% dense detection, 17.5% referring localization, 7.9% OCR, 5.8% referring segmentation, and 4.0% pointing. Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4 Training Pipeline ‣ WeVisOne-VL: Unified Visual Perceptionfrom Objects to Pixels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> shows the complete 178K-example RL task distribution, including the additional localization and pointing examples.</p>
</div>
